---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
<nav class="nav" aria-label="Hauptnavigation">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="wordmark" href="#top">TALK-TECH</a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#simulationen" data-en="Simulations">Simulationen</a>
      <a href="#mr-barker" data-en="Mr. Barker visits">Mr. Barker visits</a>
      <a href="#pilot" data-en="Pilot">Pilot</a>
      <a href="#team" data-en="Team">Team</a>
    </div>
    <div class="lang" role="group" aria-label="Sprache">
      <button type="button" id="l-de" aria-pressed="true">DE</button>
      <button type="button" id="l-en" aria-pressed="false">EN</button>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#kontakt" data-en="Request a demo">Demo anfragen</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
  <canvas id="rain" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow hero-lead" data-en="AI conversation simulations for vocational education">KI-Gesprächssimulationen für die Berufsbildung</p>
      <h1 data-en="Every apprentice gets their <em>own technical conversation.</em>">Jede lernende Person führt ihr <em>eigenes Fachgespräch.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede" data-en="TALK-TECH builds AI-driven conversation simulations for vocational schools. For example, apprentices explain real technology to a virtual counterpart, in English and in real time. The whole class at once.">TALK-TECH entwickelt KI-gestützte Gesprächssimulationen für Berufsfachschulen. So erklären Lernende beispielsweise einem virtuellen Gegenüber reale Technik, auf Englisch und in Echtzeit. Die ganze Klasse gleichzeitig.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#kontakt" data-en="Request a demo →">Demo anfragen →</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#mr-barker" data-en="See the simulation">Simulation ansehen</a>
      </div>
      <dl class="hero-facts">
        <div><dt>24</dt><dd data-en="learners at once">Lernende gleichzeitig</dd></div>
        <div><dt data-en="74.3">74,3</dt><dd data-en="SUS score in pilot">SUS-Score im Pilot</dd></div>
        <div><dt>3</dt><dd data-en="devices: web, mobile, VR">Geräte: Web, Mobile, VR</dd></div>
        <div><dt>0</dt><dd data-en="installations">Installationen</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="sim" aria-label="Beispiel eines Gesprächsverlaufs">
      <div class="sim-head">
        <img src="/avatar-mrbarker.png" alt="">
        <div><b>Mr. Barker</b><small>MR. BARKER VISITS · EN</small></div>
        <span class="live"><i></i>LIVE</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meter"><span class="on"></span><span class="on"></span><span class="on"></span></div>
      <div class="meter-l"><span>K1</span><span>K2</span><span data-en="K3 · question 7/10">K3 · Frage 7/10</span></div>
      <div class="msgs">
        <div class="msg b"><span class="tag t1">K1</span>Which component is located at position 3?</div>
        <div class="msg l">That's the radial shaft seal. It keeps the oil inside the housing.</div>
        <div class="msg b"><span class="tag t3">K3</span>The gearbox is overheating. Based on the drawing, what could be the cause?</div>
      </div>
      <div class="typing"><i></i><i></i><i></i>&nbsp;<span data-en="Learner is answering">Lernende:r antwortet</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="simulationen">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-en="Simulations">Simulationen</p>
      <h2 data-en="One platform. Many conversations.">Eine Plattform. Viele Gespräche.</h2>
      <p class="naming"><span class="brand">TALK-TECH</span><span class="sep">:</span> <span data-en="Format">Format</span> <span class="sep">–</span> <span data-en="Scenario">Szenario</span><br><span class="naming-sub" data-en="Your tailor-made simulations run on one clear platform. Teachers see at a glance which topics a simulation trains.">Ihre massgeschneiderten Simulationen laufen auf der übersichtlichen Plattform. Lehrpersonen sehen auf einen Blick, welche Themen eine Simulation trainiert.</span></p>
    </div>

    <div class="products">
      <article class="card featured">
        <span class="status s-live" data-en="Piloted · June 2026">Pilotiert · Juni 2026</span>
        <p class="kicker" data-en="TALK-TECH: Technical English Conversation">TALK-TECH: Fachgespräch Technisches Englisch</p>
        <h3>Mr. Barker visits</h3>
        <p data-en="An American business partner visits the training company and wants a full technical presentation of an assembly. In English, right now.">Ein US-amerikanischer Geschäftspartner besucht den Lehrbetrieb und will eine vollständige technische Präsentation einer Baugruppe. Auf Englisch, sofort.</p>
        <div class="chips">
          <span data-en="Polymechanics">Polymechaniker:in</span><span data-en="Automation">Automatiker:in</span><span data-en="EN · B2">EN · B2</span><span data-en="~15 min">~15 Min.</span>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#mr-barker" data-en="Explore simulation">Simulation entdecken</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <span class="status s-req" data-en="On request">Auf Anfrage</span>
        <p class="kicker" data-en="TALK-TECH: your format – your scenario">TALK-TECH: Ihr Format – Ihr Szenario</p>
        <h3 data-en="Your scenario">Ihr Szenario</h3>
        <p data-en="Scenarios are configured by prompt on the no-code platform Xara. Another assembly, profession or language needs no custom software. For example a customer complaint, a shift handover or a supplier call.">Szenarien werden per Prompt auf der No-Code-Plattform Xara konfiguriert. Eine andere Baugruppe, ein anderer Beruf oder eine andere Sprache braucht keine Eigenentwicklung. Etwa eine Kundenreklamation, eine Schichtübergabe oder ein Lieferantengespräch.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#kontakt" data-en="Discuss a scenario">Szenario besprechen</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="mr-barker" class="tight">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="explorer">
      <div class="ex-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">TALK-TECH: <span data-en="Technical English Conversation">Fachgespräch Technisches Englisch</span></p>
          <h2>Mr. Barker visits</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Mr. Barker visits">
          <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-szenario" aria-controls="p-szenario" aria-selected="true" data-en="Scenario">Szenario</button>
          <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-ablauf" aria-controls="p-ablauf" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-en="Flow">Ablauf</button>
          <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-ki" aria-controls="p-ki" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-en="Adaptive AI">Adaptive KI</button>
          <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-pilot" aria-controls="p-pilot" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-en="Pilot">Pilot</button>
          <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-daten" aria-controls="p-daten" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-en="Data sheet">Datenblatt</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panels">
        <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="p-szenario" aria-labelledby="t-szenario">
          <div class="scenario">
      <figure class="drawing" style="margin:0">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 520 300" role="img" aria-label="Schnittzeichnung einer Getriebewelle mit Positionsnummern">
          <g fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.6">
            <rect x="120" y="70" width="240" height="160" fill="var(--surface)"/>
            <path d="M120 90 L360 90 M120 210 L360 210" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width=".8" stroke-dasharray="6 4"/>
            <rect x="40" y="136" width="420" height="28" fill="var(--paper)"/>
            <rect x="140" y="112" width="34" height="76" fill="var(--surface)"/>
            <line x1="140" y1="112" x2="174" y2="188" stroke-width=".8"/><line x1="174" y1="112" x2="140" y2="188" stroke-width=".8"/>
            <rect x="306" y="112" width="34" height="76" fill="var(--surface)"/>
            <line x1="306" y1="112" x2="340" y2="188" stroke-width=".8"/><line x1="340" y1="112" x2="306" y2="188" stroke-width=".8"/>
            <rect x="206" y="84" width="68" height="132" fill="var(--surface)"/>
            <path d="M206 96 h68 M206 108 h68 M206 192 h68 M206 204 h68" stroke-width=".7"/>
            <rect x="360" y="124" width="16" height="52" fill="var(--surface)"/>
            <path d="M360 124 l16 12 M360 176 l16 -12" stroke-width=".8"/>
            <rect x="100" y="120" width="20" height="60" fill="var(--surface)"/>
          </g>
          <line x1="20" y1="150" x2="500" y2="150" stroke="var(--blue)" stroke-width=".8" stroke-dasharray="14 4 3 4"/>
          <g font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)">
            <g stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1"><line x1="240" y1="84" x2="240" y2="40"/><line x1="157" y1="112" x2="130" y2="40"/><line x1="368" y1="124" x2="420" y2="60"/><line x1="323" y1="188" x2="330" y2="262"/><line x1="70" y1="150" x2="60" y2="240"/><line x1="110" y1="180" x2="140" y2="262"/></g>
            <g fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.4"><circle cx="130" cy="30" r="13"/><circle cx="240" cy="30" r="13"/><circle cx="430" cy="50" r="13"/><circle cx="330" cy="272" r="13"/><circle cx="60" cy="250" r="13"/><circle cx="140" cy="272" r="13"/></g>
            <text x="130" y="35">1</text><text x="240" y="35">2</text>
            <circle cx="430" cy="50" r="13" fill="var(--blue)" stroke="none"/><text x="430" y="55" fill="#fff">3</text>
            <text x="330" y="277">4</text><text x="60" y="255">5</text><text x="140" y="277">6</text>
          </g>
        </svg>
        <figcaption><span data-en="Assembly: gearbox output shaft (schematic)">Baugruppe: Getriebe-Abtriebswelle (schematisch)</span><span data-en="Pos. 3 = radial shaft seal">Pos. 3 = Radial-Wellendichtring</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
            <div>
              <blockquote>«I'm interested in buying this assembly. Walk me through it. What does each part do?»</blockquote>
              <div class="who"><img src="/avatar-mrbarker.png" alt=""><div><b>Mr. Barker</b><small data-en="AI customer · USA">KI-Kunde · USA</small></div></div>
              <p class="txt" data-en="Learners work from a real engineering drawing. Components are drawn at random, so no two conversations are the same. Built for the FutureMEM reform.">Lernende arbeiten mit einer echten technischen Zeichnung. Die Bauteile werden zufällig gezogen, kein Gespräch gleicht dem anderen. Entwickelt für die Berufsreform FutureMEM.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="p-ablauf" aria-labelledby="t-ablauf" hidden>
          <div class="phases">
            <div class="phase">
              <div class="top"><span class="num">01</span><span data-en="~2 min · German">~2 Min. · Deutsch</span></div>
              <h3>Briefing</h3>
              <p data-en="Ms. Goodwill introduces the scenario and the key vocabulary in German, so every learner starts prepared.">Ms. Goodwill führt auf Deutsch ins Szenario und den Fachwortschatz ein, damit alle vorbereitet starten.</p>
              <div class="agent"><img src="/avatar-msgoodwill.png" alt="">Ms. Goodwill · <span data-en="Mentor">Mentorin</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="phase">
              <div class="top"><span class="num">02</span><span data-en="~10 min · English">~10 Min. · Englisch</span></div>
              <h3 data-en="Technical conversation">Fachgespräch</h3>
              <p data-en="Ten questions from Mr. Barker. He raises or lowers the level in real time, from naming parts to solving a fault.">Zehn Fragen von Mr. Barker. Er hebt oder senkt das Niveau in Echtzeit, vom Benennen der Teile bis zur Fehlersuche.</p>
              <div class="agent"><img src="/avatar-mrbarker.png" alt="">Mr. Barker · <span data-en="Customer">Kunde</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="phase">
              <div class="top"><span class="num">03</span><span data-en="~3 min · bilingual">~3 Min. · zweisprachig</span></div>
              <h3 data-en="Reflection">Reflexion</h3>
              <p data-en="Ms. Goodwill analyses the transcript and gives criteria-based feedback on vocabulary, grammar and fluency.">Ms. Goodwill wertet das Transkript aus und gibt kriterienbasiertes Feedback zu Wortschatz, Grammatik und Flüssigkeit.</p>
              <div class="agent"><img src="/avatar-msgoodwill.png" alt="">Ms. Goodwill · Coach</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="p-ki" aria-labelledby="t-ki" hidden>
          <div class="bloom">
            <div class="intro">
              <h3 data-en="Every learner at their own edge.">Jede lernende Person an ihrer eigenen Grenze.</h3>
              <p data-en="After two warm-up questions at K1, each answer decides the next level along Bloom's taxonomy. Strong learners get pushed, others get support.">Nach zwei Einstiegsfragen auf K1 entscheidet jede Antwort über die nächste Stufe der Bloom'schen Taxonomie. Starke Lernende werden gefordert, andere gestützt.</p>
              <div class="scale" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              <div class="scale-l"><span data-en="K1 · know">K1 · wissen</span><span data-en="K3 · apply">K3 · anwenden</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="levels">
              <div class="level"><span class="k">K1</span><div><b data-en="Knowledge">Wissen</b><p data-en="Identify and name components on the drawing.">Bauteile auf der Zeichnung erkennen und benennen.</p><q>Which component is located at position number 3?</q></div></div>
              <div class="level"><span class="k">K2</span><div><b data-en="Understanding">Verstehen</b><p data-en="Explain functions, materials and why a part is used.">Funktionen, Werkstoffe und Einsatzgründe erklären.</p><q>Why do we use a radial shaft seal at this specific position?</q></div></div>
              <div class="level"><span class="k">K3</span><div><b data-en="Application">Anwenden</b><p data-en="Diagnose a fault and propose a solution.">Einen Fehler diagnostizieren und eine Lösung vorschlagen.</p><q>The gearbox is overheating. Based on the drawing, what could be the cause?</q></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="p-pilot" aria-labelledby="t-pilot" hidden>
          <div class="pilot">
            <div>
              <p class="p-intro" data-en="A class of prospective polymechanics at Berufsschule Rüti ran the simulation on their own in June 2026 and rated it with the System Usability Scale.">Eine Klasse angehender Polymechaniker:innen der Berufsschule Rüti führte die Simulation im Juni 2026 selbstständig durch und bewertete sie mit der System Usability Scale.</p>
              <div class="chart">
                <div class="bar"><label>TALK-TECH</label><div class="track"><div class="fill us" style="width:74.3%"><span data-en="74.3">74,3</span></div></div></div>
                <div class="bar"><label data-en="Benchmark">Benchmark</label><div class="track"><div class="fill bm" style="width:68%">68</div></div></div>
                <div class="axis"><div class="spacer"></div><div><span style="left:0">0</span><span style="left:25%">25</span><span style="left:50%">50</span><span style="left:75%">75</span><span style="left:100%">100</span></div></div>
              </div>
              <div class="quote">
                <p data-en="«It was a pretty normal conversation, like it would have been with a teacher.»">«Es war eigentlich ein ziemlich normales Gespräch, wie es auch mit einem Lehrer gewesen wäre.»</p>
                <small data-en="Apprentice, polymechanics">Lernender, Polymechanik</small>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="findings">
              <p class="eyebrow" data-en="What we learned">Was wir gelernt haben</p>
              <div class="finding plus"><i>+</i><span data-en="The class ran the simulation completely on its own.">Die Klasse bediente die Simulation komplett selbstständig.</span></div>
              <div class="finding plus"><i>+</i><span data-en="Fast learning curve and a coherent system.">Schnelle Lernkurve und hohe Systemkohärenz.</span></div>
              <div class="finding minus"><i>–</i><span data-en="Speech recognition struggled at times with classroom noise.">Die Spracherkennung stiess bei Lärm im Klassenzimmer vereinzelt an Grenzen.</span></div>
              <div class="finding minus"><i>–</i><span data-en="The difficulty has to match the class.">Der Schwierigkeitsgrad muss zur Klasse passen.</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="p-daten" aria-labelledby="t-daten" hidden>
          <div class="tbl"><table>
        <tr><th data-en="Target group">Zielgruppe</th><td data-en="Polymechanics and automation apprentices, MEM professions">Polymechaniker:innen, Automatiker:innen, MEM-Berufe</td></tr>
        <tr><th data-en="Curriculum">Lehrplan</th><td data-en="FutureMEM, technical English, language level B2">FutureMEM, Technisches Englisch, Sprachniveau B2</td></tr>
        <tr><th data-en="Duration">Dauer</th><td data-en="approx. 15 min per learner (briefing, 10 questions, reflection)">ca. 15 Min. pro Person (Briefing, 10 Fragen, Reflexion)</td></tr>
        <tr><th data-en="Devices">Geräte</th><td data-en="Browser (classroom), smartphone, VR headset. No installation.">Browser (Klassenzimmer), Smartphone, VR-Brille. Keine Installation.</td></tr>
        <tr><th data-en="AI agents">KI-Agenten</th><td data-en="Ms. Goodwill (mentor and coach), Mr. Barker (customer)">Ms. Goodwill (Mentorin und Coach), Mr. Barker (Kunde)</td></tr>
        <tr><th data-en="Technology">Technologie</th><td>Xara XR · Azure OpenAI GPT-4o · Azure Speech Services</td></tr>
        <tr><th data-en="Teaching material">Begleitmaterial</th><td data-en="Worksheet with technical drawing, vocabulary list">Arbeitsblatt mit technischer Zeichnung, Wortliste</td></tr>
          </table></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ex-foot">
        <button type="button" class="step" id="prev" aria-label="Vorheriger Tab">←</button>
        <span class="count mono" id="count">1 / 5</span>
        <button type="button" class="step" id="next" aria-label="Nächster Tab"><span id="next-l">Ablauf</span> →</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="team" class="tight">
  <div class="wrap about">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Team</p>
      <h2 data-en="Built by teachers, for teachers.">Gebaut von Lehrpersonen für Lehrpersonen.</h2>
      <p data-en="We teach at Swiss vocational schools and train at PHZH. TALK-TECH started in the IMMERSE innovation structure and was presented at hackAstone 2026.">Wir unterrichten an Schweizer Berufsfachschulen und bilden uns an der PH Zürich weiter. TALK-TECH entstand in der Innovationsstruktur IMMERSE und am hackAstone 2026.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <ul class="team">
        <li><span class="ini">OS</span><b>Oliver Schulthess</b></li>
        <li><span class="ini">JS</span><b>Jonas Schubnell</b></li>
        <li><span class="ini">AS</span><b>Aaron Schmid</b></li>
        <li><span class="ini">CS</span><b>Colin Schmid</b></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="partners"><span class="eyebrow" data-en="Partners">Partner</span>
        <a href="https://phzh.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PHZH</a>
        <a href="https://afca.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">afca. ag</a>
        <a href="https://phzh.ch/de/ueber-die-phzh/themen-und-taetigkeiten/projekte/immerse/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IMMERSE</a>
        <a href="https://futuremem.swiss" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FutureMEM</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="kontakt">
  <div class="wrap contact">
    <div class="side">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-en="Contact">Kontakt</p>
      <h2 data-en="Let Mr. Barker visit your class.">Lassen Sie Mr. Barker Ihre Klasse besuchen.</h2>
      <p data-en="Tell us who you are and what you need. We reply personally, usually within a week.">Sagen Sie uns, wer Sie sind und was Sie brauchen. Wir antworten persönlich, meist innerhalb einer Woche.</p>
    </div>
    <form id="f" name="kontakt" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" action="/danke/" novalidate>
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="kontakt">
      <p hidden><label>Nicht ausfüllen: <input name="bot-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></p>
      <fieldset>
        <legend data-en="I'm writing as">Ich schreibe als</legend>
        <div class="aud">
          <label><input type="radio" name="aud" id="a-school" value="Berufsfachschule" checked><span class="opt"><b data-en="Vocational school">Berufsfachschule</b><small data-en="Teacher or school management">Lehrperson oder Schulleitung</small></span></label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="aud" id="a-assoc" value="Verband / Lehrmittel"><span class="opt"><b data-en="Association / publisher">Verband / Lehrmittel</b><small data-en="Integration into teaching materials">Integration in Lehrmittel</small></span></label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="aud" id="a-comp" value="Lehrbetrieb"><span class="opt"><b data-en="Training company">Lehrbetrieb</b><small data-en="Scenarios for your apprentices">Szenarien für Ihre Lernenden</small></span></label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>
      <div class="row">
        <div><label class="fl" for="n" data-en="Name">Name</label><input type="text" id="n" name="name" autocomplete="name" required></div>
        <div><label class="fl" for="o" data-en="Organisation">Organisation</label><input type="text" id="o" name="organisation" autocomplete="organization"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div><label class="fl" for="e" data-en="Email">E-Mail</label><input type="email" id="e" name="email" autocomplete="email" required></div>
        <div><label class="fl" for="w" data-en="Interest">Anliegen</label>
          <select id="w" name="anliegen"></select></div>
      </div>
      <div><label class="fl" for="m" data-en="Message">Nachricht</label><textarea id="m" name="nachricht" data-ph-de="z. B. 2. Lehrjahr Polymechanik, 22 Lernende, Start nach den Herbstferien" data-ph-en="e.g. 2nd-year polymechanics, 22 learners, start after autumn break"></textarea></div>
      <div class="form-foot">
        <small data-en="We only use your details to reply to your request.">Wir verwenden Ihre Angaben nur, um Ihre Anfrage zu beantworten.</small>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" data-en="Send request">Anfrage senden</button>
      </div>
      <div class="done" id="done" hidden></div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>


<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
